Two blocks that interpolate the same local name (`backgroundColor`) under
different selectors get different variables, also when minified: the
selector is part of the variable seed.

  $ refmt --parse re --print ml input.re > output.ml
  $ ../../standalone.exe --minify --impl output.ml -o output.ml
  $ styled-ppx.generate output.ml > styles.css
  $ cat styles.css
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  @property --vdivhzj{syntax:"*";inherits:false;}@property --vdiv4fw{syntax:"*";inherits:false;}.css-vdivf4z{background-color:var(--vdivhzj);}.css-vdivtr7:hover{background-color:var(--vdiv4fw);}
